(7129813, 1090048, 117534, '<td valign="top">Very unique, very nicely done, the boken (I can NOT spell that) is so soft, my only critique is I would''ve liked to see a little more softness to the leaf. but still a very worthy photo</td>', 'Very unique, very nicely done, the boken (I can NOT spell that) is so soft, my only critique is I would''ve liked to see a little more softness to the leaf. but still a very worthy photo', '2013-11-14 00:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129814, 1091953, 117534, '<td valign="top">A good photo to me, makes me stop and study or come back again... I''ve come back to this 4 times and have spent more time studying it that all the other Poppy fall color beautiful photos. At first my reaction was WHOA way to much crunchy dead trees, but the more I stare the more I see total art and a lot of thought and a fantastic composition so from first impression of MEH I am now at Freakin'' fantastic... 9</td>', 'A good photo to me, makes me stop and study or come back again... I''ve come back to this 4 times and have spent more time studying it that all the other Poppy fall color beautiful photos. At first my reaction was WHOA way to much crunchy dead trees, but the more I stare the more I see total art and a lot of thought and a fantastic composition so from first impression of MEH I am now at Freakin'' fantastic... 9', '2013-11-14 00:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
