(7131202, 1091761, 37719, '<td valign="top">when I was a teenager (hmm...42 years ago) I had this poster on my wall that was of a forrest at dawn and all you saw was all these trees with long, tall trunks and orange/gold leaves and kind of a wispy haze and I used to sit and abuse all kinds of substances in front of this poster and imagine.  I mean this thing was huge, like a whole wall.  And this was very close to being reminiscent of that until I saw the person in blue.  It was quiet until he stirred things up with all that bright color.  Just doesn''t fit IMO although I do respect the introspection of the image.  <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>And for the record...10</td>', 'when I was a teenager (hmm...42 years ago) I had this poster on my wall that was of a forrest at dawn and all you saw was all these trees with long, tall trunks and orange/gold leaves and kind of a wispy haze and I used to sit and abuse all kinds of substances in front of this poster and imagine.  I mean this thing was huge, like a whole wall.  And this was very close to being reminiscent of that until I saw the person in blue.  It was quiet until he stirred things up with all that bright color.  Just doesn''t fit IMO although I do respect the introspection of the image.      And for the record...10', '2013-11-17 20:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131203, 1091495, 37719, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Love the left to right color shift.  Very well done!</td>', 'Wow!  Love the left to right color shift.  Very well done!', '2013-11-17 20:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131205, 1088877, 37719, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting and I can very much appreciate the decision you had to make when it came to cropping (if it was an option) and composition (the perspective is unique and very well presented).</td>', 'This is very interesting and I can very much appreciate the decision you had to make when it came to cropping (if it was an option) and composition (the perspective is unique and very well presented).', '2013-11-17 20:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
