(7132800, 1091506, 30861, '<td valign="top">thgis is REALLY nicely done.The moraine and its reflection are so... what/... SPECIFIC?... I can''t put my finger on it, but that raw left side kind of presages the forest edge on the right. The runner''s a grace note. Good work! Some may think it''s too soft, but soft works for me.</td>', 'thgis is REALLY nicely done.The moraine and its reflection are so... what/... SPECIFIC?... I can''t put my finger on it, but that raw left side kind of presages the forest edge on the right. The runner''s a grace note. Good work! Some may think it''s too soft, but soft works for me.', '2013-11-20 17:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132803, 1091944, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is potentially very nice, but from my POV you have a problem: it feels like a "reverse vignette": the center''s darker and the left edge is bleeding off. I''d love to take a crack at the original on this one...</td>', 'This is potentially very nice, but from my POV you have a problem: it feels like a "reverse vignette": the center''s darker and the left edge is bleeding off. I''d love to take a crack at the original on this one...', '2013-11-20 17:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132804, 1089198, 30861, '<td valign="top">Havin'' fun, Margaret? there''s a terrific balancing act going on here.</td>', 'Havin'' fun, Margaret? there''s a terrific balancing act going on here.', '2013-11-20 17:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132805, 1089255, 30861, '<td valign="top">this is RICH! love it!</td>', 'this is RICH! love it!', '2013-11-20 17:43:31.000000', NULL, 1);
