(7132882, 1087960, 30861, '<td valign="top">Extraordinarily detailed rendition. Bizarre how lack of ears weirds the viewer out, or at least this viewer anyway. Cracks me up how minimalized the leaf has become. All in all, one of my faves in a quirky way.</td>', 'Extraordinarily detailed rendition. Bizarre how lack of ears weirds the viewer out, or at least this viewer anyway. Cracks me up how minimalized the leaf has become. All in all, one of my faves in a quirky way.', '2013-11-20 21:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7132883, 1091506, 104230, '<td valign="top">Wonderful intersecting lines and patterns to explore and enjoy. I remember the first time I saw larch trees in the Canadian Rockies as they were starting to turn. I assume that''s what these are, or at else something closely related! Back to bump.</td>', 'Wonderful intersecting lines and patterns to explore and enjoy. I remember the first time I saw larch trees in the Canadian Rockies as they were starting to turn. I assume that''s what these are, or at else something closely related! Back to bump.', '2013-11-20 21:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
