(7133016, 1091970, 124815, '<td valign="top"><i>  A sense of security, of well-being, of summer warmth pervades my memory. That robust reality makes a ghost of the present. The mirror brims with brightness; a bumblebee has entered the room and bumps against the ceiling. Everything is as it should be, nothing will ever change, nobody will ever die.<br/></i> <br/>Nabokov "Speak Memory"<br/> <br/></td>', '  A sense of security, of well-being, of summer warmth pervades my memory. That robust reality makes a ghost of the present. The mirror brims with brightness; a bumblebee has entered the room and bumps against the ceiling. Everything is as it should be, nothing will ever change, nobody will ever die. Nabokov "Speak Memory" ', '2013-11-21 00:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
