(7133372, 1087960, 109387, '<td valign="top">I''ve to say that I''m one of those who are very surprised of this second place. The image is stunning. One of the best animal portraits I have ever seen, not only on DPC. But that''s what it is, an animal portrait :)</td>', 'I''ve to say that I''m one of those who are very surprised of this second place. The image is stunning. One of the best animal portraits I have ever seen, not only on DPC. But that''s what it is, an animal portrait :)', '2013-11-21 17:34:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7133387, 1091989, 64844, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your lovely comments! They compensate a bit for the position at the bottom of the challenge! <br/>Actually I had a fantastic picture in mind, being here in the country of the beautiful autumn leaves! <br/>However the foliage season is late here, and during the few outings I had, I only saw green leaves :(<br/>Still, I kind of liked this one, too, for the atmosphere of solitude. <br/>Thank you so much for your good votes!</td>', 'Thank you for your lovely comments! They compensate a bit for the position at the bottom of the challenge! Actually I had a fantastic picture in mind, being here in the country of the beautiful autumn leaves! However the foliage season is late here, and during the few outings I had, I only saw green leaves :(Still, I kind of liked this one, too, for the atmosphere of solitude. Thank you so much for your good votes!', '2013-11-21 19:16:40.000000', NULL, 0),
