(7133777, 1089154, 96509, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> It almost looks like an overlay, the way the leaves merge into the bark.  I suspect a bit of a convoluted reflection sort of thing? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Technically, it is an overlay although an analogic one instead of Photoshop. No reflection though, just double exposure.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-11-22 21:24:13.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: It almost looks like an overlay, the way the leaves merge into the bark.  I suspect a bit of a convoluted reflection sort of thing?   Technically, it is an overlay although an analogic one instead of Photoshop. No reflection though, just double exposure.', '2013-11-22 18:15:05.000000', '2013-11-22 21:24:13.000000', 0),
