(7137090, 1091761, 37719, '<td valign="top">I have come to grips with my initial response to the woman in blue (see, she so disturbed me the first rounds through that I mis-identified her gender).  I guess others did not have the same poster that I did. I would love to be at this location at dawn, early fall, wide angle low to the ground and facing sunrise and much closer to the trees - just a vision. <br/> <br/>Just made the image a favorite. Points are not only on the ends of pencils you see.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-12-01 17:10:21.</i></td>', 'I have come to grips with my initial response to the woman in blue (see, she so disturbed me the first rounds through that I mis-identified her gender).  I guess others did not have the same poster that I did. I would love to be at this location at dawn, early fall, wide angle low to the ground and facing sunrise and much closer to the trees - just a vision.  Just made the image a favorite. Points are not only on the ends of pencils you see.', '2013-12-01 17:09:38.000000', '2013-12-01 17:10:21.000000', 0),
